    "Script created for awk, a text processing program that is included with Unix and Linux operating system distributions; contains instructions for matching, replacing, and printing text from an input string or file; used for producing formatted text and reports. Mac awk. MacVim. Apple TextEdit Included with OS. Other text editor Linux awk. Vim. Other text editor.",
