    "3.8",
    "Script written for NUKE or NUKEX, a program used for creating high-quality film and animations; saves a set of instructions for composing an animation; can include node creation and steps for motion and effects; can be visually edited in the NUKE software or hand coded in a text editor. NOTE: NUKE is used in many Hollywood animation films. Windows The Foundry NUKE.",
