    "3.7",
    "File generated by Visual Studio, an integrated development environment (IDE) created by Microsoft; contains intermediate information extracted from source files in a project; used for generating a.BSC file, which can be used to browse application symbols. Windows Microsoft Visual Studio 2022.",
    "Windows Microsoft Visual Studio 2022.",
