    "3.6",
    "Extension that expands the capabilities of Visual Basic scripts and programs; included with the Microsoft Visual Basic Control Development Kit (CDK); can be debugged using the Windbg debugger (WinDbg.exe) or CodeView for Windows (Cvw.exe). VBX files may be referenced by Visual Basic programs, such as Microsoft Visual Basic and WScript. Windows Microsoft WinDbg. Microsoft CodeView.",
