    ".FRAMEWORK",
    "Mac OS X Application Framework",
    "3.6",
    "Folder containing supporting programs, libraries, or references to other files used by a Mac OS X program; usually located in the Contents/​Frameworks folder within a Mac OS X application package. NOTE: The file can be opened by right-clicking the application icon and selecting Show Package Contents.. Mac Opens as folder in Mac OS X.",
    "Mac Opens as folder in Mac OS X.",
