    "3.5",
    "Project file used by Borland Developer Studio, a software development application that was the predecessor to Delphi; used for saving and loading the project and contains compiler settings, references to project source code files, and other project settings. The BDSPROJ format was replaced by the.DPROJ format in Delphi 2007. Windows Embarcadero Delphi.",
