    ".MCP",
    "CodeWarrior Project",
    "3.5",
    "Development project created by CodeWarrior, a C and C++ development IDE; saves references to project source code and resource files, as well as project specific preferences; originally used by Metrowerks CodeWarrior (MCP), which is now Freescale CodeWarrior. Windows Freescale CodeWarrior. IPTV (Internet Protocol TV) channel data file used by Megacubo, a Spanish online TV streaming application; contains multiple.MEGA files, each of which defines an online channel that can be streamed to the local computer. MCP files are typically downloded from the Megacubo website. Once the Megacubo software has been installed, you can double-click an MCP file to install the channels. Windows MegacuboFree.",
