    "3.5",
    "Lisp file referenced by Emacs, a basic multi-platform text editor; contains Lisp code that may define Emacs configuraton settings or may add additional features to the program. NOTE: EL files that provide extra program features are often saved as compiled.ELC files, which allows them load faster. Windows GNU Emacs. Mac GNU Emacs. Linux GNU EmacsFree.",
