    "Source code file written for NetLogo, a program used for creating agent-based models that simulate complex natural and social phenomena; stores source code that drives the model when run; written in the NetLogo language. Windows NetLogo. Any text editor Mac NetLogo. Any text editor Linux NetLogoNetLogo Any text editor. File used by Microsoft Windows; contains language translation information that allows Windows to convert between different character sets; commonly found in the Windows/​System32 directory. Windows may display error messages if NLS files are deleted or if their permissions are incorrectly set. Consult Microsoft help documentation to fix this problem. Windows Microsoft Windows.",
