    ".A2W",
    "Alice World",
    "3.3",
    "3D world created with Alice, a Java-based educational programming tool used for creating animations and interactive game; defines a three-dimensional space, or world, that contains 3D objects; compressed in a standard.ZIP format. Mac Alice. Windows Alice. Linux AliceFree. Instrument banks created by Adlib Tracker II, a 18 channel FM audio tracking application; contains instruments used to create compositions in the Adlib Tracker II program; same as.A2B files but holds macros as well. NOTE: A2W files are similar to the original.BNK files used by the Reality Adlib Tracker program. Windows Adlib Tracker IIFree.",
