    "Form•Z Script",
    "2.8",
    "Script written in the form•Z scripting language (FSL), a plugin development language for form•Z 3D solids and surfaces modeling software; uses syntax similar to the C programming language but is more simplified; can use functions specified in the FSL API. When a script is complete, it is compiled into a binary representation in a.FSB file, which is read by form•Z. Windows AutoDesSys form•Z. Mac AutoDesSys form•Z.",
