    ".ROTEST",
    "RemObjects SDK Test File",
    "2.7",
    "Developer file created using the RemObjects SDK, a remoting framework used for building networked data-driven applications; contains settings for testing a RemObjects service; used by Service Tester, a RemObjects SDK utility for stress testing applications. Windows RemObjects SDK.",
