    "2.0",
    "Data file created by Adobe Lightroom version 1, the first installment of the photo management application; stores information about a collection of images that have been imported into the software; enables storage of organized photo data. Later versions of Lightroom use.LRCAT files for photo catalog information. NOTE: Lightroom was formerly known as Photoshop Lightroom. Windows Adobe Lightroom. Mac Adobe Lightroom.",
