    "FinalBuilder 7 Project",
    "2.0",
    "Project file created by FinalBuilder 7, an application used for building a software development project into a final Windows program; contains build properties and references to the file required for building the final program; can be used for automated builds. FinalBuilder projects are also saved with the.FBZ7 extension, which is the default extension used for FinalBuilder 7 projects. FBZ7 files use compression to reduce the file size. NOTE: Some versions of Embarcadero Delphi include FinalBuilder. Windows VSoft Technologies FinalBuilder.",
